  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Potatoes with Honey-Scallion Sauce",
  "description": "Potato wedges wrapped in bacon are shallow-fried and drizzled with a honey-scallion sauce in this quick and easy recipe for a rich side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah Stone"
  ],
